#. 今は…まだ詳しい事は話せん…
#. 時機を見させてくれ…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure I'm ready to open up just yet... Maybe if\n"
"you create the right opportunity..."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0002 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Sakura"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. それでも大神さんと一緒に過ごそうか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I hang out with Sakura for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 話さなくても…いいのか…？
msgctxt "0005 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Even if I don't feel like talking...?"
msgstr ""

#. それでも…我と一緒にいてくれると言うのか？
msgctxt "0006 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You'll still stand by me?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木よ、お主は変わったヤツだな。
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I still don't understand you, Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言葉を交わす事もなく、
#. ボクは、じっと大神さんの傍にいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without saying a word, I stood by Sakura...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Sakura a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
